    {
      "id": "claim_c10fc4e6e1af4b728a90fe17990b5b65",
      "statement": "The brain loop: `brain_ask` runs the hybrid search (text alone without a provider), lists the decisions touching the question with their status and the follow-ups due, and records a consultation (`brain_consultations`: id, question, hits, outcome) whose id `brain_decide` needs; `brain_decide` writes a `decision` page under `decisions/` (question, choice, rationale, alternatives, a wikilink per consulted page, `status: decided`, `decided`, `follow_up_by`, `consulted`, `supersedes`), adds a timeline entry to every consulted page, marks a superseded decision, and sets the consultation's outcome; `brain_follow_up` appends a dated outcome and sets kept, revised or superseded (with the successor); `brain_no_decision` records the reason; `brain_due` lists the follow-ups due within `days` and every decision.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://crates/rusty-core/src/brain/decisions.rs",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:1f1f0fbbe172b34264e448cf01a335ba89d103a7882c3983919686c826aa162f"
